What is Cloud? ☁️

In simple words, cloud computing means using computers, storage, databases, software, and AI services through the internet instead of owning and managing everything on your own computer.

Simple example

Without cloud:

Your Chromebook
     ↓
Run everything on your own device

With cloud:

Your Chromebook
     ↓ Internet 🌐
Cloud Server ☁️
     ↓
Your Application / Database / AI Model

For example, your College AI Assistant runs like this:

Your User
   ↓
Google Cloud Run ☁️
   ↓
FastAPI Application
   ↓
Google Vertex AI
   ↓
Fine-Tuned Gemini Model 🤖

